<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Donnkenny cut to sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Donnkenny cut to sell.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has cut Donnkenny Inc to sell from buy, a Prudential source said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
